{"id":"n49056-1-8","stage":1,"title":"섭섭하다 · 难舍","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49056-1-8-1","ko":"이렇게 헤어지면 몇 년 뒤에나 다시 보겠지?","zh":"这次分别后，得过几年才能再见吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어지면","meaning":"分别、分开（这里是在送别）","explanation":"헤어지다：分别、分开（这里是在送别）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어지면","audio":"/audio/596869f6bf68cc2de430.mp3"}},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年。","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에나","meaning":"后，之后，后来","explanation":"뒤：后，之后，后来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에나","audio":"/audio/490d1d29df62f07dbcaa.mp3"}},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再次，再一次","explanation":"다시：再次，再一次。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entry